{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42402","headline":"哭刑部侍郎乔公诗 · 徐铉","name":"哭刑部侍郎乔公诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举世重文雅，夫君更质真。\n曾嗟混鸡鹤，终日异淄磷。\n词赋离骚客，封章谏诤臣。\n襟怀道家侣，标格古时人。\n逸老诚云福，遗形未免贫。\n求文空得草，埋玉遂爲尘。\n静想忘年契，冥思按武晨。\n连宵洽杯酒，分日掌丝纶。\n蠹简书陈事，遗孤托世亲。\n前贤同此叹，非我独沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}